\newlabel{fig:pairs}{{2}{13}{Mean AUC on later burning of the thermal RF minus that of each location-using candidate, with 95\% bootstrap intervals over fires. Filled circles: later burning to the end of 2023 (\sAElig {} fires). Hollow squares: later burning from January 2024 to September 2026 (\sBElig {} fires). Values above zero mean that the thermal RF ranked later burning better. In both windows the pooled AUC chose the candidate in every fire}{figure.2}{}}
